{"id":"conscient","lemma":"conscient","pos":"adj","rank":2770,"glosses":["Physically alert; conscious","aware of something's implications or consequences"],"ipa":"/kɔ̃.sjɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/20/Fr-conscient.ogg/Fr-conscient.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"consciente","masculinePlural":"conscients","femininePlural":"conscientes"},"formAudio":{"consciente":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-consciente.wav","conscients":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-conscients.wav","conscientes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Totodu74-conscientes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il doit être conscient du danger.","en":"He must be aware of the danger.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"danger"}]},{"text":"Je suis consciente de votre problème.","en":"I'm aware of your problem.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},{"g":"problem"}]},{"text":"Nous en sommes tous conscients maintenant.","en":"We're all aware of it now.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"all"},null,{"g":"now, currently"}]},{"text":"Je suis conscient de tout cela.","en":"I'm aware of all that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"that"}]},{"text":"Nous sommes conscientes de cela.","en":"We're aware of that.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that"}]}]}